{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22216","headline":"食笋 · 白居易","name":"食笋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此州乃竹乡，春笋满山谷。\n山夫折盈抱，抱来早市鬻。\n物以多爲贱，双钱易一束。\n置之炊甑中，与饭同时熟。\n紫箨坼故锦，素肌擘新玉。\n每日遂加餐，经时不思肉。\n久爲京洛客，此味常不足。\n且食勿踟蹰，南风吹作竹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}